The fear of
repetition. The
memory of
destruction. The
priests know the
pattern. Enthusiasm
breeds chaos.
Chaos breeds
violence. Violence
breeds Roman
retribution. And
retribution
destroys
Jerusalem.

* [The priests are right to fear.] -> priests_right_fear
* [But fear should not prevent truth.] -> fear_prevent_truth
* [The truth is more powerful.] -> truth_more

