The consequences
arrive swiftly.
Within hours,
the Sanhedrin
will convene.
Within days,
the priests
will plot.
Within weeks,
the crowd that
shouted "Hosanna"
will shout
"Crucify."

* [The crowd turns quickly.] -> crowd_turns
* [Hosanna becomes crucify.] -> hosanna_crucify
* [Enthusiasm fades.] -> enthusiasm_fades

