They cannot
control Rome.
No more than
a child can
control the
ocean. Rome
responds to
threats with
overwhelming
force. The
priests know
this. The
people do not.

* [The people do not understand.] -> people_unaware
* [The priests manipulate fear.] -> priests_manipulate
* [Fear is a powerful weapon.] -> fear_weapon

